  "instructions": {
    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "content": [
          "This Genie Agent analyzes the Lab 06 Synthea Healthcare Gold model.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "Business definitions:\r\n",
          "- An encounter is one healthcare encounter in fact_encounters.\r\n",
          "- A condition event is one patient-condition occurrence in fact_conditions.\r\n",
          "- Total healthcare cost is total_claim_cost.\r\n",
          "- Payer contribution is payer_coverage.\r\n",
          "- Patient responsibility is patient_responsibility.\r\n",
          "- Encounter duration is measured in duration_minutes.\r\n",
          "- Emergency encounter percentage is emergency encounters divided by total encounters.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "Prefer these aggregate tables when possible:\r\n",
          "- Time-series analysis: agg_daily_encounters\r\n",
          "- Organization analysis: agg_organization_performance\r\n",
          "- Payer analysis: agg_payer_performance\r\n",
          "- Condition analysis: agg_condition_summary\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "Prefer readable organization names, payer names, condition descriptions and dates instead of surrogate keys.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "Respect all Unity Catalog row filters and column masks.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "Which organizations had the most encounters?\r\n",
          "What were the top 10 medical conditions by number of events?\r\n",
          "Show monthly encounter volume in 2021.\r\n",
          "Which payer covered the most healthcare cost?\r\n",
          "What is the average encounter duration by encounter class?"
        ],
        "id": "01f19ce9baa41ef7aa0ddd67d033d313"
      }
    ]
  },
  "version": 2
